{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/extras/library_logo.png?t=1743893333\" />Step into the past and rebuild history with Epoch Makers, a cooperative renovation and restoration simulation designed for your buddies. Work together to repair, clean, and reconstruct some of the world\u2019s most iconic historical landmarks while experiencing the challenges of their original construction.\u00a0Will you restore history to its former glory, or will your renovations take an unexpected turn? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/extras/HighresScreenshot00005.png?t=1743893333\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Each location is a journey through time, from half-built medieval castles to ancient temples left in decay. Using a variety of tools, materials, and techniques, you\u2019ll face unique challenges that test your teamwork, precision, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 However, cooperation isn't always guaranteed\u2014your buddies might have other plans! Push, trip, or sabotage each other with hilarious pranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 As you restore these historical sites, unexpected events will keep you on your toes. Unstable scaffolding, mischievous animals, and even supernatural occurrences may turn your careful planning into pure chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Whether you're racing against time or simply enjoying the creative process, every session offers a new and unpredictable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Will you become a master builder, or will your historical restorations end in disaster? Grab your tools, team up (or mess with each other), and reshape history one brick at a time!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512870?t=1743893333","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743893333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/757b01f477735cad1fda113e925131d1d7417c76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743893333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/757b01f477735cad1fda113e925131d1d7417c76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743893333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/extras/library_logo.png?t=1743893333\" />Step into the past and rebuild history with Epoch Makers, a cooperative renovation and restoration simulation designed for your buddies. Work together to repair, clean, and reconstruct some of the world\u2019s most iconic historical landmarks while experiencing the challenges of their original construction.\u00a0Will you restore history to its former glory, or will your renovations take an unexpected turn? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512870/extras/HighresScreenshot00005.png?t=1743893333\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Each location is a journey through time, from half-built medieval castles to ancient temples left in decay. Using a variety of tools, materials, and techniques, you\u2019ll face unique challenges that test your teamwork, precision, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_para